  "note": "Median milliseconds per call after one warm-up call, on one Mac (darwin-arm64, Node 24). A call whose warm-up took over 2 s is recorded once (runs: 1). Keys m1, m12, m150, m500 are memberships of the signed-in user. before is origin/main at 305c65b (merge of #301), after is perf/scale-100k with the surfaces commits. branchBeforeMayUseFix is perf/scale-100k at 4986a669b, before the mayUse change. Regenerate with SURFACES_OUT=<file> SURFACES_LABEL=<label> vitest run --config tests/bench/surfaces.vitest.config.ts from packages/permdock; SURFACES_PG_URL=<postgres url> adds the PowerSync row counts. The runner is not a gate: timings on a shared machine move by 10 to 20 percent.",
